    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been recruited for a space exploration mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your orders are simple: <strong>walk to the bridge at the end of the corridor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something isn\u2019t right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no bridge, only another corridor. And each time you walk through, things begin to <strong>change</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it a glitch in the system? A test? A trap? Or something more sinister?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you see something different, turn back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If everything is normal, carry on.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do this correctly and eventually you'll make it 'To The Bridge'.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Our Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691270/extras/18219f184489d6505e7b8a0601648a48.avif?t=1752770200\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15\u201360 minutes depending on observation and decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you <strong>make the right choices</strong> to finally reach the bridge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short atmospheric walking simulator</strong> with a sci-fi theme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looping corridor gameplay</strong>: each loop might appear normal... or subtly (or overtly) different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation-based puzzle mechanics</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <strong>everything is normal</strong>, carry on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If <strong>something is different</strong>, go back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wrong and the loop resets.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist controls</strong> focused entirely on walking and watching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a small rolling droid</strong> companion that appears in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle horror and psychological tension</strong> as you question reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> to enhance the feeling of isolation and unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set aboard a dark, looping spaceship corridor</strong> with dynamic lighting and sci-fi visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Speedrun Mode</strong>: Successfully make it to the bridge to unlock a speedrun mode with a built in timing system.</p></li></ul>",
