ing is different</strong>, go back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wrong and the loop resets.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist controls</strong> focused entirely on walking and watching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a small rolling droid</strong> companion that appears in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle horror and psychological tension</strong> as you question reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> to enhance the feeling of isolation and unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set aboard a dark, looping spaceship corridor</strong> with dynamic lighting and sci-fi visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Speedrun Mode</strong>: Successfully make it to the bridge to unlock a speedrun mode with a built in timing system.</p></li></ul>",
